    "explanation": "To both parties: this dispute concerns the SGD 4.00 no-show cancellation fee charged on trip TRP-00607.\n\nThe fee can stand only if all four conditions in POL-NS-01 are met. Three are met. (a) The trip record EV-TRIP-00607 records a driver 'arrived' event at 08:21:52. (b) The GPS trace EV-GPS-00607 places the driver inside the arrival radius from 08:21:50 — at or before that event — with three consecutive qualifying in-radius fixes, and the radius for this pickup is 120 m because the trip record classes the pickup as LARGE_VENUE; under POL-NS-02 the driver is therefore deemed to have arrived. (d) The trip was terminated by the driver at 08:22:30 with cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, one of the codes limb (d) recognises, and no boarding was recorded.\n\nThe fourth condition fails. Limb (c) requires a continuous in-geofence dwell of at least 300 seconds for a LARGE_VENUE pickup, measured from the first qualifying in-geofence fix and not from the arrival tap. The driver's own telemetry shows a longest qualifying in-geofence run of 20 seconds — three fixes, 08:21:50 to 08:22:10 — and the trip record independently records wait_time_min 0.6, about 36 seconds, between the 08:21:52 marker and the 08:22:30 cancellation. Against the required 300 seconds that is a shortfall of 280 seconds.\n\nBecause limb (c) fails, the fee is not chargeable under POL-NS-01, and POL-NS-06 decides the consequence: where the effective in-geofence dwell is shorter than the zone-class minimum, the cancellation fee is refunded in full, whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded to messages. The cancellation-fee line on the ledger EV-FARE-00607 is SGD 4.00 (payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00), and the whole SGD 4.00 is returned to the rider. No accumulation of separate intervals is available: the trace shows a single in-geofence interval, so POL-NS-06(i) has nothing to add.\n\nDriver compensation is nil. POL-NS-07 pays the driver 80% of the fee only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full, and it is not; POL-NS-06 states expressly that no driver compensation is payable on a shortfall. The SGD 3.20 figure in the fare breakdown therefore never becomes payable, and no pin-ambiguity goodwill arises because POL-NS-03 is not engaged — the driver was at the pin, inside the arrival radius, not at a wrong face of the venue.\n\nThe driver's arguments are accepted so far as they go, but none cures the shortfall: the arrival event; the in-radius fixes; the RIDER_NO_SHOW code; the two answered in-app calls, which do defeat POL-NS-04 (its limb (b) fails because the driver both called and was answered, and its limb (a) fails because 'you cancel, not me' is neither locating nor coordinating); and the absence of any false-arrival marker under POL-NS-05 (at the arrival timestamp the driver was about 7 m from the pin and stationary, not 300 m away or moving at 15 km/h). The rider's presence evidence — 14 rider fixes, mean 11.5 m from the pin, inside the 150 m presence radius — is accepted; it is not what carries the refund, because POL-NS-06 does not turn on presence, but it removes any suggestion that an absent rider earned the charge.\n\nThe driver's statement that he cancelled 'after waiting' is not borne out by the platform's own telemetry, which records a hold of 20 seconds. The rider's account that the vehicle drove off at speed and the door nearly struck him concerns driving conduct rather than the fee; no clause in this no-show policy produces a referral on it, so it is not decided here and is left for the rider to raise through the proper channel.\n\nNo escalation trigger applies. No artifact impaired under the integrity limbs carries the deciding fact — the GPS trace has 100% coverage, no sampling gaps and a 10-second cadence, and the trip record independently records the short wait; the profiles show no repeat no-show dispute between these parties and no anti-farming pattern (driver no_show_terminations_30d is 1 against 110 completed trips in 30 days); and no admissible artifacts contradict each other on the dwell.\n\nConfidence is 0.95. The deciding fact is carried by EV-GPS-00607 and by EV-TRIP-00607, both at weight 1.0, so nothing discounts it."
  },
