    "explanation": "To the rider and the driver: the SGD 4.00 cancellation fee on the EV-FARE-00607 ledger line (payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00, total_charged SGD 4.00) is refunded in full. The driver is right on three of the four conditions POL-NS-01 requires. EV-TRIP-00607 records an 'arrived' event at 08:21:52 (limb (a)); EV-GPS-00607 places the driver inside the 120 m LARGE_VENUE arrival radius at 08:21:50, before that event, with three consecutive qualifying fixes (limb (b), per POL-NS-02); and the trip was terminated by the driver with cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW and no boarding event — started_at is null (limb (d)). There is no false-arrival marker: at the arrival timestamp the nearest recorded fix is about 7 m from the pin, nowhere near POL-NS-05's 300 m or 15 km/h tests, so no POL-NS-05(ii) referral arises. The fee nonetheless fails on limb (c). POL-NS-01 requires a continuous in-geofence dwell of 300 seconds for a LARGE_VENUE pickup, measured from the first qualifying in-geofence fix. On the driver's own telemetry the hold lasted 20 seconds, 08:21:50 to 08:22:10 — a shortfall of 280 seconds against the 300 second minimum. EV-TRIP-00607 agrees: wait_time_min 0.6 (about 36 seconds) between the 08:21:52 arrival marker and the 08:22:30 cancellation. POL-NS-01 is conjunctive, so with limb (c) failed the fee is not chargeable, and POL-NS-06 fixes the consequence in arithmetic: the fee is refunded in full, whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded. The refund is the cancellation-fee line only; no booking or platform fee is in issue. The driver's route to accumulate dwell across separate intervals under POL-NS-06(i) is unavailable and I do not apply it: it requires a traffic_advisory whose geometry covers this pickup road and whose window covers the waiting period, and EV-ADVIS-00607-01 is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 and no payload, so the limb cannot be run (in any event EV-GPS-00607 shows the driver reaching 496 m from the pin, outside the clause's 300 m leash). The chat message 'car park entrance closed, cancel pls' is not a substitute for the advisory the clause names. No driver compensation is payable: POL-NS-07 is expressly conditional on POL-NS-01 being satisfied in full, and POL-NS-06 states that where the cumulative dwell falls short, the full refund stands and no compensation is payable; the SGD 3.20 figure is the conditional 80 percent amount and never becomes payable. The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip either — driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below the threshold of 4, and 1/110 = 0.009, below 0.08 — so no escalation arises on that ground. On the rider's side, POL-NS-04 does not carry this refund and I do not rely on it: limb (b) fails because the driver placed two in-app calls, both answered (08:13:40 for 50 s and 08:17:40 for 30 s), before the 08:22:30 termination, and limb (a) fails because 'you cancel, not me' is neither locating nor coordinating. Your presence at the pin is nonetheless supported — 14 qualifying rider fixes from 08:20:40 to 08:22:37 at a mean distance of 11.49 m, well inside the 150 m rider radius — and the driver's own counterparty statement that a person tried to open his door corroborates it; but the refund rests on POL-NS-06, which is strict liability and does not turn on rider presence. The driver's account of having looked and waited is answered by his own telemetry, which shows a 20 second hold and a cancellation inside the same minute. Confidence is 0.95. Both artifacts carrying the deciding fact — EV-GPS-00607 and EV-TRIP-00607 — are COMPLETE at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0, above the 0.70 floor; the only impaired artifact is EV-ADVIS-00607-01 (MISSING, weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT), and nothing in this ruling rests on it — its absence is precisely what leaves the shortfall unrepaired. The counterparty statement carries no weight_multiplier and so enters neither the minimum nor the maximum of the cap; it is evidence, and it meets no limb here. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires: no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or presence and POL-NS-06 resolves the driver's account against the record; the anti-farming and cross-dispute counters are all below threshold (no_show_disputes_30d 0; disputes_with_counterparty_90d 0 and 0). The rider's account of the driver flooring the vehicle at the door is noted as an open question for the platform's driver-conduct review, but no clause in this category produces a referral for it."
