    "explanation": "Rider — your dispute succeeds. Driver — the cancellation fee is refunded to the rider and no compensation is payable to you.\n\nWhy the charge cannot stand. POL-NS-01 is conjunctive: the driver side must carry all four limbs, and the fee is chargeable only if every one holds. Limb (a) is met (EV-TRIP-00607 carries a driver 'arrived' event at 08:21:52); limb (b) is met (EV-GPS-00607 shows three consecutive in-radius fixes from 08:21:50, inside the 120 m LARGE_VENUE arrival radius, the first preceding the arrival event, so POL-NS-02 deems arrival); limb (d) is met (the trip was terminated by the driver with cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, a code limb (d) recognises, with no boarding event). Limb (c) fails on the driver's own telemetry: the pickup is a LARGE_VENUE zone (EV-TRIP-00607), so the required continuous in-geofence dwell is 300 seconds, but the longest qualifying run in EV-GPS-00607 is 3 fixes from 08:21:50 to 08:22:10 — a dwell of 20 seconds, measured from the first qualifying fix and not from the arrival marker, exactly as limb (c) directs. That is a shortfall of 280 seconds; the trip record's wait_time_min of 0.6 (about 36 s) is consistent. A conjunctive clause fails if any single limb fails.\n\nPOL-NS-06 then fixes the remedy in arithmetic, and it is strict liability: 300 seconds required, 20 seconds measured, and where the effective dwell is shorter than the minimum the fee is not chargeable and is refunded in full, whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded. The fee in issue is the cancellation-fee line of EV-FARE-00607 — SGD 4.00, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00 — and the whole of it is returned. The accumulation route in POL-NS-06(i) is unavailable on this record: the traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00607-01 is MISSING (weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT), so the driver's chat message that the car park entrance was closed is uncorroborated and neither extends nor excuses the shortfall.\n\nThe other candidate clauses do not displace the refund. POL-NS-03 does not apply: the driver was inside the arrival radius, not at a wrong face of the venue — the closest recorded fix was about 7 m from the pin, nowhere near the 400 m wrong-entrance test. POL-NS-05 does not apply: the arrival marker was legitimate (the driver was stationary inside the geofence, not more than 300 m out and not in motion at or above 15 km/h), so the waiting clock is not reset and no false-arrival referral is recorded. POL-NS-04 does not apply either — the rider's only message, 'you cancel, not me' at 08:15:40, gives no position, entrance, block or bay and requests none, so limb (a) is not satisfied, and the driver placed two answered in-app calls (08:13:40, 50 s; 08:17:40, 30 s) before the 08:22:30 cancellation, so limb (b) fails as well — but none of that matters to the money, because POL-NS-06 does not turn on rider presence or rider response.\n\nThe rider's presence point is accepted but not needed: EV-GPS-00607's rider track carries 14 qualifying fixes from 08:20:40 to 08:22:37 at a mean of 11.49 m from the pin, well inside the 150 m LARGE_VENUE rider-presence radius. It answers any suggestion that the fee was earned against an absent rider, but the refund already follows from the dwell shortfall alone.\n\nDriver compensation is nil. POL-NS-07 is expressly conditional on POL-NS-01 being satisfied in full, and it is not, and POL-NS-06 states in terms that where cumulative dwell falls short of the minimum the full refund stands and no driver compensation is payable. The SGD 3.20 that would have been payable on a verified no-show therefore never becomes due.\n\nConfidence and escalation. The deciding fact — the 20-second dwell against the 300-second minimum — is carried by EV-GPS-00607 and EV-TRIP-00607, each at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the cap under POL-GEN-02(2) is 1.0 and my confidence is 0.9, above the 0.70 floor. None of the POL-NS-09 triggers fires: there is no impairment under POL-NS-08(a)–(d) (arrival-to-fix offset 2 s, well under 90 s; max_gap_sec 0.0 with 71 fixes and the rider track present; the chat holds 2 messages, matching trip_record.chat_message_count; and the SGD 4.00 cancellation fee equals the greater of the LARGE_VENUE zone-class fee and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee, SGD 4.00, so POL-NS-08(d) reconciles); no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence; the same-pair dispute counters are 0 and 0; and the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below 4, against 110 completed_trips_30d). No referral is produced by any clause.\n\nFor the human reviewer, an open question the money does not reach (not a referral): the rider's account that the vehicle moved off as the door was held, and the driver's account that he took the person at the door to be a different booking, are a conduct matter outside this category's remedies; nothing in the loaded policy directs a referral for it.",
